   This is a repost of the Boston party details.
I'm sending it to both extropian and exi-boston lists so that not to
miss anyone.
------------------------------------------------------------------------
 
  The party will take place on December, 29 1992, starting at around noon.
You are welcome to come anytime from noon to the next noon.
I will do my best to provide enough clean space and food for all ;)
To make it easier I would appreciate if you tell me when you can be 
present and whether you have any special requirements.
 
You may consider bringing things of interest for other extropians:
books, papers, software (I have a PC at home), tapes, smart drinks etc.
Maybe, something funny too - it's Ex-Mass, after all!   ;-)
 
You don't have to bring anything (or even respond), but you have to
use the right address:
 
6 McLean Pl. apt. 5 Cambridge MA 02140-2410    (red brick house)
Tel. (617) 864-3382 - home,   (617) 684-0146 ext. 35 - work. ("Alex")
 
